Bundle-Name: Gecko Weather Runtime Remote Configuration
Bundle-Description: Configurator defaults that put the weather runtime into a Fennec Services (DDSR) \
	registry: the Remote Service Admin's provider role and the WeatherOutlook component it exports. \
	Environment variables override every value (configadmin interpolation plugin).

-resourceonly: true
-includeresource: OSGI-INF/configurator/=configs/
Require-Capability: \
	osgi.extender;filter:='(osgi.extender=osgi.configurator)'
